# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build context filter for the OmniGet images.
# Keeping this small matters: the Rust builder downloads the whole workspace
# and an accidental `src-tauri/target` copy is several GB.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# VCS / CI
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.github

# Frontend dependencies and build output (the frontend stage produces its own)
node_modules
build
.svelte-kit
package

# Rust build artefacts
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/gen

# Website / documentation / packaging — not part of the app binary
assets
docs
flatpak
**/*.md
!docker/README.md

# Local environment files and editor state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db